title.narrative:
•	Strengthened security of HRDs participating in the program through the development of comprehensive individually tailored security plans;
•	Increased mental health and resilience capacity of HRDs as the result of psychological counseling and consultations;
•	Strengthened capacity and basic skills of the participants through training and education and improved network of international professional and media contacts of HRDs participants of the program; 
•	Increased insensitivity of the advocacy campaigns in favor of HRDs’ mental health awareness.
